{"10":[{"k":"p","t":"OPERATOR OPTIONAL SWITCH SETTINGS"},{"k":"p","t":"The option switches are located on the CPU board. The option switches and audio control can be reached through the back of the machine."},{"k":"p","t":"The following settings will assist you with your selections:"},{"k":"p","t":"OPTIONAL SWITCH SETTINGS"},{"k":"p","t":"Switches 1 and 2 control the number of times the player may have his spaceship destroyed before the game is over. The following truth table lists these switch settings:"},{"k":"tr","t":"SWITCH 1:   SWITCH 2:   NUMBER OF SPACESHIPS:"},{"k":"tr","t":"OFF   OFF   6"},{"k":"tr","t":"ON   OFF   5"},{"k":"tr","t":"OFF   ON   4"},{"k":"tr","t":"ON   ON   3"},{"k":"p","t":"Switches 3 and 4 control the score at which one or two free spaceships are awarded according to the following truth table: FIRST FREE SECOND FREE"},{"k":"tr","t":"SWITCH 3:   SWITCH 4:   SHIP SCORE:   SHIP SCORE:"},{"k":"tr","t":"OFF   OFF   6,000   60,000"},{"k":"tr","t":"ON   OFF   5,000   50,000"},{"k":"tr","t":"OFF   on   4,000   40,000"},{"k":"tr","t":"ON   ON   3,000   30,000"},{"k":"p","t":"SWITCH 5: OFF - 25\u00a2 PER GAME."},{"k":"p","t":"ON - 50\u00a2 PER GAME."},{"k":"p","t":"Switches 6, 7 and 8 are factory adjustments, and must be left in OFF position."}],"11":[{"k":"p","t":"CPU BOARD ASSEMBLY #50330008"},{"k":"p","t":"PARTS LIST"},{"k":"p","t":"NO. PART NUMBER: DESCRIPTION: USAGE:"},{"k":"tr","t":"1   50010249LS 74LS245 I.c.   1"},{"k":"tr","t":"2   50010252LS 74LS374 I.C.   3"},{"k":"tr","t":"3   50010273LS 74LS244 I.C.   2"},{"k":"tr","t":"4   50010275LS 74LS136 I.C.   1"},{"k":"tr","t":"5   50010248LS 74LS138 I.c.   4"},{"k":"tr","t":"6   50010221LS 74LS163 I.C.   3"},{"k":"tr","t":"7   50010045LS 74LS157 I.C.   3"},{"k":"tr","t":"8   50010002LS 74LS00 I.c.   4"},{"k":"tr","t":"9   50010096LS 74LS08 I.c.   3"},{"k":"tr","t":"10   50010141LS 74LS125 I.c.   1"},{"k":"tr","t":"11   50010105LS 74LS32 I.c.   4"},{"k":"tr","t":"12   50010170LS 74LS14 I.c.   1"}